          "Maintain baseline constituent service responsiveness across the entire district; an unopposed 2024 result means a challenger has no recent data about whether the incumbent's relationships are genuinely deep or merely consolidated among core supporters, and the absence of electoral pressure can create vulnerability if constituent service quality declines or becomes uneven across neighborhoods.",
          "Address education and economic mobility specifically for a 28.1% college-attainment, 37-year-old, working-class urban constituency for whom the pathway from education to stable middle-class employment is the primary economic concern; workforce development, CUNY affordability, and job accessibility from this district's neighborhoods are concrete policy levers that translate into constituent loyalty."
