          "Engage young adults' economic mobility concerns with specificity—student debt policy, entry-level job market pathways, and the relationship between educational attainment and wage growth are the lived experience of a 24.6-year median age constituency evaluating whether government policy is expanding or constraining their economic futures.",
          "Serve the Latino and Asian communities with active constituent attention: at 9.26% and 8.44% respectively, these are meaningful minority populations whose representation cannot default to generic multicultural framing—their economic concerns, immigration policy positions, and healthcare access are specific and deserve specific engagement.",
