          "Build specific constituent relationships with the Hispanic plurality and Black community around the issues that organize their economic concerns: immigration status anxiety and access to public benefits for mixed-status families, healthcare access and Medicaid availability, school quality and educational opportunity, and wage policy that reflects the actual earning floor for working-class adults without college degrees.",
