          "Build authentic relationships with the 11.4% Hispanic/Latino and 7.42% Asian communities within the affluent framework of the district; these constituencies are not marginal but integral parts of a district where income and education are distributed across ethnic lines, and targeted outreach prevents a challenger from organizing swing support.",
          "Treat the unopposed victory as a warning, not a mandate — any incumbent who assumes that an unopposed race indicates durable support is vulnerable to a well-organized challenger who can mobilize even 10-15% of affluent homeowners frustrated by specific governance failures or service decline."
