          "Monitor the college-attainment gap (25.7%, well below citywide averages) and economic mobility narratives: a district with limited bachelor's degree completion and working-class income concentration will respond to candidates who speak to workforce development, apprenticeship access, and whether government is creating pathways to economic advancement rather than managing decline."
