          "Engage the 67% Black and Hispanic constituency with specific economic equity outcomes: median income and college attainment data mask significant racial wealth gaps; constituent evaluation will center on whether state senate action has produced measurable gains in Black and Hispanic homeownership, small business capital access, and career pathway opportunity.",
